# raspudger credentials (OPTIONAL).
#
# The usual way to authenticate is the browser login, which uses your Claude
# subscription and persists in data/agent-home:
#
#   ./rasp --agent=claude --login
#
# You only need this file for non-interactive use (for example CI), where a
# browser login is not possible. Copy it to config.env and set one value.
# config.env is gitignored; never commit real credentials.

# Subscription token from `claude setup-token` (uses your plan, no API billing).
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Anthropic API key (billed per token, separate from your subscription).
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/ under API Keys. rasp holds this key
# in a model proxy sidecar and points the agent at it, so the key never enters
# the agent container; pass --no-model-proxy to inject it directly instead.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
